And there's another stronger social network, a link in your social network. What other behavioral mental health problems do you see among children and parents of more privileged families? Anything beyond depression, substance abuse? Yes, we have, in order, if I were to go in order, the problems that we've seen among upper middle class kids is starting with alcohol and drug use,
这会形成一个更强大的社交网络，是你社交网络中的一个环节。在更优越的家庭的孩子和父母中，你还看到了哪些其他的行为心理健康问题？除了抑郁和药物滥用之外还有什么吗？是的，如果我们按顺序排列，我们在中上层阶级孩子身上看到的问题，首先是酒精和药物使用，

