deal to us. If I feel like my work, my career brings me such enormous gratification, somewhere subconsciously, otherwise I want my child to have a very successful career path, too, so that he or she can have the same gratification. That can lead us to, again, inadvertently doing and saying things that we don't mean to. Yes, it's lovely if my child has a PhD, but you know what? There are other things in life. As I often tell young people, including my own children, when they're applying to college, you'll get an education. It's all right.
如果我觉得我的工作、我的职业带给我巨大的满足感，在潜意识里，或者其他方面，我也希望我的孩子有非常成功的职业道路，这样他或她也能获得同样的满足感。这可能导致我们再次无意中做和说一些我们本意并非如此的事情。是的，如果我的孩子有博士学位当然很好，但你知道吗？生活中还有其他事情。正如我经常告诉年轻人的，包括我自己的孩子，当他们申请大学时，你会接受教育的。没关系。

